<title>UK: Last three July Brent cargoes kept - trade.</title>
<headline>Last three July Brent cargoes kept - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>All three Brent crude oil cargoes which turned wet on Monday were kept before the five o'clock deadline , traders said.</p>
<p>Equity holder Shell U.K. kept one cargo and Stasco kept the remaining two cargoes.</p>
<p>--Siobhan Hayden London Newsroom +44 171 542 8978</p>
</text>
